<div id="top" class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero-title"><em>Ethereal</em> Aperture</h1>

  <div class="defs">
    <dl>
      <dt>ethereal <span>adj.</span></dt>
      <dd class="sense">extremely delicate, light, not of this world.</dd>
      <dd class="gloss">
        Photography is fleeting. The light is there for a second and then it isn't, and some of it will never come back the same way.
      </dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
      <dt>aperture <span>n.</span></dt>
      <dd class="sense">an opening, hole, or gap; the opening in a lens that admits light.</dd>
      <dd class="gloss">
        The photographs are openings of their own — into what we noticed, what we were willing to look at, and what we made from it.
      </dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="aside">And I really love alliteration.</p>
  </div>

